// complete, UNASSIGNED asset. SceneSwitch.cs already demonstrates swapping
// runtimeAnimatorController, which is the technique this lesson teaches. Both
// controllers carry the same three parameters — IsWalking (Bool), WalkDir (Int),
// Attack (Trigger) — so the swap needs no change to any of 1.6's code.
