// That line carries the only idea in this lesson with no precedent anywhere
// before it. Everything this game has remembered so far has been a NUMBER that
// changed; the boolean is the same old shape (a coin count that can only be 0 or
// 1), and the new thing is that the axe changes what the player IS.
//
// The old shape of this page was an API table, a "Build Lab" that was really
